  "demo": {
    "title": "マスクを塗って筆跡を誘導する",
    "caption": "初期値は窓辺の机、マスク全体は灰色（α≈0.5）、筆の重み75%、候補1200個、勾配基準180、線長16px、太さ3px、シード42です。マスクを指やマウスで塗り、黒・白・灰色の場所で確率と筆跡を比べます。",
    "html": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"ja\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;padding:12px;background:#f4f0e7;color:#29383d;font:15px/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif}.controls{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(145px,1fr));gap:8px}label{display:grid;gap:4px;font-size:13px}select,input,button{min-height:44px;padding:7px;border:1px solid #c8c1b5;border-radius:7px;background:#fff;color:inherit;font:inherit}input[type=range]{padding:0;accent-color:#3d7d83}.wide{grid-column:span 2}.row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}.row input{flex:1}.actions{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}.paint{touch-action:none;cursor:crosshair}.views{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px;margin-top:12px}.panel{min-width:0}.panel b{font-size:13px}canvas{width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.5;display:block;border:1px solid #cfc8bb;background:#fff}.note{min-height:1.5em;font-size:13px;color:#52666a}@media(max-width:650px){.views{grid-template-columns:1fr}}@media(max-width:450px){body{padding:8px}.controls{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.wide{grid-column:span 2}}</style></head><body><div class=\"controls\"><label>元の絵<select id=\"source\"><option value=\"desk\">窓辺の机</option><option value=\"plant\">鉢植え</option><option value=\"hill\">丘と雲</option></select></label><label>筆の大きさ<select id=\"radius\"><option>18</option><option selected>36</option><option>64</option></select></label><label class=\"wide\">筆の暗さの重み α<div class=\"row\"><span>輪郭 0%</span><input id=\"brush\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" step=\"5\" value=\"75\"><output id=\"brushOut\">75%</output><span>暗さ 100%</span></div></label><div class=\"wide actions\"><button id=\"all0\">全体を輪郭重視</button><button id=\"all50\">全体を半分ずつ</button><button id=\"all100\">全体を暗さ重視</button></div><label>候補数<select id=\"count\"><option>500</option><option selected>1200</option><option>2400</option></select></label><label>勾配基準<select id=\"ref\"><option>90</option><option selected>180</option><option>360</option></select></label><label>線の長さ<select id=\"length\"><option>8</option><option selected>16</option><option>24</option></select></label><label>線の太さ<select id=\"width\"><option>1</option><option selected>3</option><option>5</option></select></label><label>色<select id=\"color\"><option value=\"sample\">元の色</option><option value=\"gray\">白黒</option><option value=\"warm\">朱色</option></select></label><label>シード<input id=\"seed\" type=\"number\" value=\"42\"></label><label><span>勾配の向き</span><input id=\"guides\" type=\"checkbox\"></label><button id=\"redraw\">描き直す</button><button id=\"newseed\">別のシード</button></div><p>マスクを指やマウスでなぞり、場所ごとの重みを塗ってください。塗った値は描き直しても残ります。</p><div class=\"views\"><div class=\"panel\"><b>元の絵</b><canvas id=\"src\" aria-label=\"選択した元の絵\"></canvas></div><div class=\"panel\"><b>重みマスク（指・マウスで塗る）</b><canvas id=\"mask\" class=\"paint\" aria-label=\"暗さと輪郭の重みを手描きで設定するマスク\"></canvas></div><div class=\"panel\"><b>採用確率マップ</b><canvas id=\"map\" aria-label=\"暗さと輪郭を混ぜた筆跡確率\"></canvas></div><div class=\"panel\"><b>抽選で残った筆跡</b><canvas id=\"out\" aria-label=\"マスクで指定した重みを使った筆跡\"></canvas></div></div><p id=\"info\" class=\"note\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><script>\nconst W=480,H=320,src=document.querySelector(\"#src\"),sc=src.getContext(\"2d\"),mask=document.querySelector(\"#mask\"),mctx=mask.getContext(\"2d\"),map=document.querySelector(\"#map\"),mc=map.getContext(\"2d\"),out=document.querySelector(\"#out\"),ctx=out.getContext(\"2d\");for(let c of [src,mask,map,out]){c.width=W;c.height=H}\nfunction gray(a,x,y){x=Math.max(0,Math.min(W-1,x));y=Math.max(0,Math.min(H-1,y));let i=(y*W+x)*4;return .299*a[i]+.587*a[i+1]+.114*a[i+2]}\nfunction source(k){sc.fillStyle=\"#eee9dd\";sc.fillRect(0,0,W,H);if(k===\"desk\"){sc.fillStyle=\"#c8dedc\";sc.fillRect(0,0,W,210);sc.fillStyle=\"#b89570\";sc.fillRect(0,210,W,110);sc.fillStyle=\"#8fb9bd\";sc.fillRect(38,28,125,140);sc.fillStyle=\"rgba(255,242,196,.58)\";sc.beginPath();sc.moveTo(163,40);sc.lineTo(328,210);sc.lineTo(125,210);sc.fill();sc.fillStyle=\"#faf6eb\";sc.fillRect(174,174,128,35);sc.fillStyle=\"#78604b\";sc.fillRect(345,154,68,70);sc.fillStyle=\"#eee8dc\";sc.beginPath();sc.ellipse(379,154,34,8,0,0,6.3);sc.fill()}else if(k===\"plant\"){sc.fillStyle=\"#c8dedc\";sc.fillRect(0,0,165,H);sc.strokeStyle=\"#fff\";sc.lineWidth=6;sc.beginPath();sc.moveTo(82,0);sc.lineTo(82,H);sc.moveTo(0,155);sc.lineTo(165,155);sc.stroke();sc.strokeStyle=\"#506e53\";sc.lineWidth=5;sc.beginPath();sc.moveTo(290,280);sc.lineTo(280,75);sc.stroke();for(let i=0;i<8;i++){sc.fillStyle=i%2?\"#708f67\":\"#496b50\";sc.beginPath();sc.ellipse(210+(i%3)*52,80+Math.floor(i/3)*57,42,17,-.5,0,6.3);sc.fill()}sc.fillStyle=\"#ad7054\";sc.fillRect(238,240,92,64)}else{sc.fillStyle=\"#a9cdd0\";sc.fillRect(0,0,W,205);sc.fillStyle=\"#e9d9b8\";sc.fillRect(0,205,W,115);for(let i=0;i<4;i++){sc.fillStyle=[\"#788c75\",\"#697e70\",\"#859276\",\"#637b71\"][i];sc.beginPath();sc.moveTo(0,210-i*35);for(let x=0;x<=W;x+=5)sc.lineTo(x,210-i*35-Math.sin(x*.012+i)*40);sc.lineTo(W,H);sc.lineTo(0,H);sc.fill()}}}\nfunction prob(g,m,a){return a*(1-g/255)+(1-a)*Math.min(m/(+document.querySelector(\"#ref\").value),1)}\nfunction paintAll(v){mctx.fillStyle=\"rgb(\"+Math.round(v*2.55)+\",\"+Math.round(v*2.55)+\",\"+Math.round(v*2.55)+\")\";mctx.fillRect(0,0,W,H);draw()}\nlet painting=false;function dab(e){let r=mask.getBoundingClientRect(),x=(e.clientX-r.left)*W/r.width,y=(e.clientY-r.top)*H/r.height;mctx.strokeStyle=\"rgb(\"+Math.round(+document.querySelector(\"#brush\").value*2.55)+\",\"+Math.round(+document.querySelector(\"#brush\").value*2.55)+\",\"+Math.round(+document.querySelector(\"#brush\").value*2.55)+\")\";mctx.lineWidth=+document.querySelector(\"#radius\").value;mctx.lineCap=\"round\";mctx.beginPath();mctx.moveTo(x,y);mctx.lineTo(x+.01,y+.01);mctx.stroke();draw()}mask.addEventListener(\"pointerdown\",e=>{painting=true;mask.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);dab(e)});mask.addEventListener(\"pointermove\",e=>{if(painting)dab(e)});mask.addEventListener(\"pointerup\",()=>painting=false);mask.addEventListener(\"pointercancel\",()=>painting=false);\nfunction draw(){source(document.querySelector(\"#source\").value);let a=sc.getImageData(0,0,W,H).data,mi=mctx.getImageData(0,0,W,H).data,im=mc.createImageData(W,H);for(let y=0;y<H;y++)for(let x=0;x<W;x++){let i=(y*W+x)*4,gx=gray(a,x+1,y)-gray(a,x-1,y),gy=gray(a,x,y+1)-gray(a,x,y-1),alpha=mi[i]/255,p=prob(gray(a,x,y),Math.hypot(gx,gy),alpha),v=Math.round(255*p);im.data[i]=247-v*.45;im.data[i+1]=243-v*.51;im.data[i+2]=232-v*.55;im.data[i+3]=255}mc.putImageData(im,0,0);ctx.fillStyle=\"#f4f0e6\";ctx.fillRect(0,0,W,H);let seed=Math.floor(+document.querySelector(\"#seed\").value||1);seed=(seed-1)%2147483646+1;function rand(){seed=seed*16807%2147483647;return(seed-1)/2147483646}let n=+document.querySelector(\"#count\").value,len=+document.querySelector(\"#length\").value,lw=+document.querySelector(\"#width\").value,mode=document.querySelector(\"#color\").value,kept=0;for(let j=0;j<n;j++){let x=rand()*W,y=rand()*H,ix=Math.floor(x),iy=Math.floor(y),i=(iy*W+ix)*4,R=a[i],G=a[i+1],B=a[i+2],g=.299*R+.587*G+.114*B,gx=gray(a,ix+1,iy)-gray(a,ix-1,iy),gy=gray(a,ix,iy+1)-gray(a,ix,iy-1),m=Math.hypot(gx,gy),alpha=mi[i]/255,p=prob(g,m,alpha),ang=m<4?0:Math.atan2(gy,gx)+Math.PI/2;if(rand()<p){kept++;ctx.strokeStyle=mode===\"warm\"?\"#bd5d45\":mode===\"gray\"?\"rgb(\"+g+\",\"+g+\",\"+g+\")\":\"rgb(\"+R+\",\"+G+\",\"+B+\")\";ctx.lineWidth=lw;ctx.lineCap=\"round\";ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(x-Math.cos(ang)*len/2,y-Math.sin(ang)*len/2);ctx.lineTo(x+Math.cos(ang)*len/2,y+Math.sin(ang)*len/2);ctx.stroke()}}document.querySelector(\"#brushOut\").textContent=document.querySelector(\"#brush\").value+\"%\";document.querySelector(\"#info\").textContent=\"候補 \"+n+\" 個・採用 \"+kept+\" 個。マスクが黒い場所は輪郭、白い場所は暗さを優先します。\"}\nfor(let id of [\"source\",\"brush\",\"radius\",\"count\",\"ref\",\"length\",\"width\",\"color\",\"seed\",\"guides\"]){let e=document.querySelector(\"#\"+id);e.addEventListener(\"input\",draw);e.addEventListener(\"change\",draw)}document.querySelector(\"#all0\").onclick=()=>paintAll(0);document.querySelector(\"#all50\").onclick=()=>paintAll(50);document.querySelector(\"#all100\").onclick=()=>paintAll(100);document.querySelector(\"#redraw\").onclick=draw;document.querySelector(\"#newseed\").onclick=()=>{let e=document.querySelector(\"#seed\");e.value=String((+e.value||1)+1);draw()};window.addEventListener(\"message\",e=>{if(e.data?.type===\"gal-experiment\")for(let c of e.data.controls||[]){let el=document.querySelector(c.selector);if(el){el.value=c.value;el.dispatchEvent(new Event(\"change\"))}}});mctx.fillStyle=\"rgb(128,128,128)\";mctx.fillRect(0,0,W,H);draw();\n</script></body></html>"
  },
